 "text": "DISCOVER OUR NEW ARRIVALS. SHOP NOW\n\nGO TO CONTENT\nBEAUTY GENIUS\nSEARCH\nNEW\nMAKEUP\nSKIN CARE\nHAIR COLOR\nHAIR CARE & STYLING\nVIRTUAL BEAUTY TOOLS\nBEAUTY MAGAZINE\nEXPLORE\nTRY IT NOW\nVIRTUAL HAIR COLOR TRY ON\n\nTry before you dye! The Virtual Hair Color Try On tool is an immersive hair color simulator that lets you try on makeup virtually. It uses augmented reality to create highly realistic hair color results before you dye. For anyone wanting to cover grays, experiment with a new look, or just lighten a smidge, the question is the same: is guessing worth the risk? Find your perfect color match using our Hair Color try on.\n\nHOW TO USE VIRTUAL TRY ON HAIR COLOR\nskip slider\nStep 1\nTry on LIVE or upload a selfie\nStep 2\nSelect the hair color family you’d like to try\nStep 3\nBrowse shades to find your perfect color match and experiment with your look\nStep 4\nUse the compare feature for a before & after view\nTAP, TRY, DYE\nMore than\n\n200\n\nhair colors to try\nRecommended or not?\nSuggestions are based\non your\n\ncurrent hair color\nHair color renderings\nhave an average accuracy of\n\n88%\n\nTRY ON - HAIR COLOR\n\nGone are the days of applying semi-randomly selected hair dye and then manically crossing our fingers (& toes, arms, legs, eyes…). Our hair color changer lets you see if a hair color will suit you before the deed. Virtual Try On Hair Color is the most realistic and color accurate virtual hair color try on tool out there.\n\nWhether you want to stray into unknown hair color territory or find Old Reliables that are close to your natural shade, our hair color try on lets you effortlessly browse and instantly try hundreds of shades. The hair color virtual try on interface also offers live recommendations about each shade: for you, or not for you? This hair dye test is a game-changer for virtual makeovers. It lets you scout out colors, experiment with new looks, and find the hair dye that lets your most radiant self shine through. Your hair is for showing off, not showing up!.\n\nBEAUTY & THE BRAINS\n\nVirtual Try On Hair Color is driven by a stellar technology of our age: augmented reality. Augmented reality is a game-changing innovation in the world of beauty. It allows your real-time videos and uploaded photos to be overlayed with imagined, highly realistic computer-generated images. This means you can visualize what your hair color curiosity will look in real life. Our hair color generator has a high realism & color accuracy in both the Live hair color try on mode and photo mode.\n\nThe hair color changer was developed by an expert team of engineers, researchers, and scientists who are dedicated to creating sleek & immersive beauty experiences. The inclusive tracker detects your hair and creates realistic results by its near-perfect edge coverage, for all hair types and various hair styles. Artificial Intelligence is used to generate the hair color simulator’s end result. It detects your current hair color so that the color tester can be calibrated specifically to you. All shades are fine-tuned to the hue, saturation, brightness, contrast, darkness, and intensity of your live images or selfies. To achieve this degree of accuracy, your image is compared with a rich pool of existing images from people around the world, of all different ages & ethnicities. But don’t fret, your Live/selfie images are never stored.\n\nResults & lastingness will vary according to your hair’s color & condition. A patch test 48 hours before using hair colorant is always advised.\n\nWhat hair color suits me? Q&A\n\nQ: I’m looking for hair to suit my daring style. What hair color would suit me?\nA: For you, hair isn’t just a color—it’s a statement. Bolder colors show your personal style and reveal a beautiful inner confidence. But don’t forget, the wrong hair color can make your complexion look washed out. Stand out from the rest, but first take a test. Tap & Try.\n\nQ: What would I look like with brown hair?\nA: That depends on your skin tone! For example, dark browns and golds are gorgeous if you have darker skin with cool & neutral undertones. But some browns can make fairer skin with cool undertones seem washed out. Tap & Try for the virtual hair color changer result.\n\nQ: What would I look like with blonde hair?\nA: Complexion isn’t the only consideration when deciding whether to go for a new look. Hair color can also accentuate the beauty of your eye color. For this, choose a contrasting hair color, such as caramel blonde for blue eyes or soft red for emerald-green eyes. Explore how hair color can draw attention to your eyes using the Tap & Try.\n\nskip slider\nBEAUTY JUST GOT SMARTER\nVIRTUAL BEAUTY TOOLS\n\nBeauty Genius\nGet personalized beauty advice and product recommendations\n\nTRY THIS SERVICE\n\nSkin Genius\nAnalyze your skin for a custom skincare routine\n\nTRY THIS SERVICE\n\nHairColor TryOn\nLive try on your favorite hair color products\n\nTRY THIS SERVICE\n\nMen Shade Matcher\nFind the shade that will best match your natural haircolor for grey coverage\n\nTRY THIS SERVICE\n\nHair Color Concierge\nIntroducing Haircolor Concierge from the #1 at-home hair color brand.\n\nTRY THIS SERVICE\n\nIngredient Library\nWe are committed to providing you information about our ingredients\n\nLEARN MORE\nSEE ALL BEAUTY TOOLS\nHOME / VIRTUAL-TRY-ON-HAIR\nBECAUSE YOU'RE WORTH IT\nMORE TO EXPLORE\nAbout us\nBeauty Magazine\nThe Other Side\nVirtual Try-On\nSkin Genius\nBEAUTY MAGAZINE\nAll Articles\nMakeup Articles\nSkincare Articles\nHair Color Articles\nHair Style Articles\nHair Care Articles\nCUSTOMER SERVICE\nContact Us\nMy Account\nDON'T MISS A THING !\nSign up for our newsletter to get the latest beauty news, trending looks, exclusive promotions and offers.\n>\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTwitter\nPinterest\nSnapchat\nTiktok\nASK ME ANYTHING\n-en\nTikTok Shop Terms and Conditions\nConsumer Health Data Notice\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility Statement\nOnline Preferences\nTerms of Use\nUser Generated Content Permission Terms\n@ 2026 L'Oréal Paris\n\nThis site is intended for US consumers. Cookies and related technology are used for advertising. To learn more, or opt-out, visit AdChoices and our privacy policy.\n\n \n\nYour Privacy Choices Notice at Collection\nGIVE YOUR FEEDBACK !\nGIVE YOUR FEEDBACK !",
